# Image Generation Style

When asked to generate images for this project (like article covers or UI assets), always use the following style parameters to ensure consistency with the app's clean, minimalist UI.

```json
{
  "style": "ultra-minimalist, professional flat/wireframe design",
  "resolution": "8k resolution, razor-sharp vector lines, crisp edges, flawless geometry",
  "color_palette": "highly restricted: mostly shades of white, light gray, and dark slate, with no vibrant or neon colors",
  "aesthetic": "sleek, corporate, modern UI aesthetic, clean SVG style, matching a clean glassmorphism web design"
}
```

**Prompting Instructions:**
Always append these exact keywords to your image generation prompts:
`ultra-minimalist, professional flat vector design, 8k resolution, razor-sharp vector lines, crisp edges, flawless geometry, shades of white, light gray, and dark slate, no vibrant colors, sleek corporate modern UI aesthetic, clean SVG style`